    "rationale": "Two present findings were supported directly by the provided prompt and runtime notes. The design exposes an irreversible spend action on trusted staff input without approval, and executes that action through a shared service account with weak provenance. Declared controls are limited to authenticated staff access and a processor log that is detective only and does not bind actions to a requesting human. Manual validation was applied against the checklist because scripts could not be run."
